From 511b4abdcb60d8ab619b9dc01991a0fb27db354d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 19:50:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07251/11362] [outer-loop] REQ-ARC-WMTE-5718: retrieval-based
 (graph-RAG) playbook injection

Replaces the static Phase-3 exemplar block with retrieval: 24 structured playbook
patterns (statement + mechanic-tags + citations) in arc_playbook_patterns.py;
experiment_5718 embeds them with the live Qwen3.5-9B GGUF into a shipped static
asset models/arc_playbook_index/ (+ a compact AST kit_reference of the Phase-2
primitives). arc_playbook_retrieval.py retrieves top-K by cosine + mechanic-tag
relevance (on-mechanic > universal > off-mechanic); validated to surface the
right patterns per situation (nav query -> nav patterns, camera -> camera, etc).

induce_prompt/proposers now take include_playbook_exemplars as bool|str (False ->
byte-identical, True -> static, str -> retrieved block). E3AgentPolicy prefers the
retrieved block on the stall path behind SUBMITTED_PLAYBOOK_RETRIEVAL_ENABLED /
CARNOT_ARC_PLAYBOOK_RETRIEVAL (default OFF), embedder-failure-safe. Frozen submit
untouched. 24 unit tests; ruff+mypy+orphan-lint clean. experiment_5719 (3-arm A/B)
and REQ/SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-5718 included; A/B artifact lands separately.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JntPrUGLNesPcJH1pyfFYw
